{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t新華社報道，原國務委員、國務院原副總理劉延東，因病於下午2時53分在北京逝世，享年81歲。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n報道形容劉延東是中國共產黨的優秀黨員，久經考驗的忠誠共產主義戰士，中共統一戰線工作和國家教育科技、醫療衛生、婦女兒童工作的傑出領導人。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n劉延東曾任第十七屆、十八屆中央政治局委員，第十屆全國政協副主席。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：鍾慧儀\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:21:24.372260+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:28:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:19:00.987041+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:35.418759+00:00","content_hash":"bb2aa75aef6b337c4fdb260a980829be6dab1f02942c78ca2a32b1a1abbbdf4d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}